{"server":"tw","storyId":"act10mini_level_act10mini_st04","groupId":"act10mini","stageId":null,"title":"孤行騎警","storyCode":"","avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act10mini/level_act10mini_st04.txt","sourceHash":"0f557a4d1861460f500d16317e59d5d139209cc636095df334e473432fd49811","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"騎警格拉尼不顧同僚反對，調查酒吧縱火案，嫌犯逃跑時意外引發了爆炸。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_storehouse"},{"type":"narration","text":"1097年11月19日 7:44 A.M."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以你們也記不得是什麼時候被人打開的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者畢恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_329_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至少得是兩個月前了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者畢恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_329_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過這邊本來就是用木頭封死的，之前有幾個孩子調皮，把木板拆了爬進去，說不定這次也一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們看到有人進出嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者畢恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_329_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有，這下面黑燈瞎火的，誰沒事往下爬啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行......我知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，果然還是不行啊......明明那麼可疑。到現在為止，我都已經查到六個被重新啟用的廢棄結構層出入口了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很多證人也能證明地下通道晚上確實有拖動東西的聲音。感染者社區的氛圍也不太對勁，總覺得有人在裡面動手腳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的沒人有理由啟用這些廢棄的出入口啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（拍了拍臉）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，還是不想這些了。瑣碎的小事和關係城市存亡的大事都一樣重要，嗯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看看還有什麼......哦對......貝希曼伯爵家的盜竊案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這要從哪兒開始查起呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......會是誰呢？能從守衛森嚴的大貴族家偷東西，這不是普通的竊賊能做出來的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"按伯爵家僕人的說法，那個盜賊在感染者社區神出鬼沒，那麼，他要嘛非常熟悉感染者社區的地形，要嘛掌握了特殊的源石技藝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——當然，前提是他們沒有為推卸責任而撒謊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯，應該不會。最近半個月我聽到過很多起類似的報案，卡拉頓城應該確實有那麼一個流竄的慣偷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奇怪的盜賊、特殊的源石技藝......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，去感染者社區看看吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_G7_decisivebattlealley_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_243","isRemote":false,"text":"小格拉尼，終於找到你了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薩妮大嬸？別著急別著急，有什麼事嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_243","isRemote":false,"text":"我的小絨跑丟了，我已經找了兩個小時了，快幫我找找它！它那麼乖，從來沒有瞎跑過，會不會是被什麼壞人給......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別多想，大嬸，我馬上去幫您找！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_243","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝，謝謝！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小絨跑丟之前發生過什麼嗎？您有沒有問過周圍的人？......啊，大嬸，您別急，慢慢說......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一小時後。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來，薩妮大嬸，小絨找到了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_243","isRemote":false,"text":"呀......讓我看看。呼，還好還好......沒有受傷。真對不起啊，小格拉尼，明知道你工作那麼忙，還要用找寵物這樣的小事來麻煩你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"才沒有呢。要是小絨真的沒了，您要傷心多久呀，這怎麼能算是小事呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_243","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，我聽隔壁的老約翰說，你在警備隊處境也不是很好，前幾天好像還因為什麼事被訓斥了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈......其實也沒什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過薩妮大嬸，飼養羽獸的話，還是建議用籠子關起來哦......咬到人的話就不好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_243","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，你說的有道理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說起來，薩妮大嬸。你最近在感染者社區有見到什麼陌生人嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_243","isRemote":false,"text":"陌生人？這個社區很多人都是從其他城市來的，有陌生人也不奇怪啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我指的是那種......嗯......比如掌握一些奇怪的源石技藝的感染者？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_243","isRemote":false,"text":"這個啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_243","isRemote":false,"text":"上個月感染者社區停電那個事情你知道吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊！我知道，就是感染者社區的發電機被人惡意破壞那個案子？不過犯人一直沒找到......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是我聽說供電很快就恢復了，有人修好了發電機？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_243","isRemote":false,"text":"是！我聽說他們找來了一個很厲害的工程術師，幾個小時不到就把發電機修好了！但是感染者社區怎麼會有這麼厲害的工程術師呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是......確實有點奇怪......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_offce"},{"type":"narration","text":"1097年11月20日 6:44 P.M."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是我今天的工作報告，請長官過目。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"警備隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，兩起盜竊、卡拉頓城流言調查報告......都是什麼玩意兒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"警備隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"貝希曼伯爵家的盜竊案呢！都多久了，進展呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個，不是才一天多嗎......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"警備隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"一天還不夠嗎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"警備隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"我花大力氣借調你的時候，騎警隊可是說你是查案的一把好手。結果呢？小小一個失竊，一天時間都不夠嗎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）明明是城鎮議會借調的騎警隊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"警備隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"夠了！目無尊長，頂撞上級，這就是騎警隊的規矩嗎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，長官！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"警備隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"“調查了幾個廢棄結構層出入口，那些出入口果然很可疑，詢問周邊的居民......”怎麼又是這些事！不是都說了不用管嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"警備隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"卡拉頓城每天發生的怪事沒有一千件也有五百件，要是警備隊的每個人都像你這麼疑神疑鬼，我早就被煩死了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是長官，這些事如果放著不查的話，真的可能......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"警備隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"少說那些廢話，回去查案！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是，長官！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_mini01_naturalspark"},{"type":"narration","text":"1097年11月22日 10:20 A.M."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小~蘇~茜~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"讓我揉一揉你的耳朵！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈，發生什麼事了，格拉尼警官？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夏櫟","speakerId":"avg_492_quercu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"工作上的事情吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......沒什麼，就是最近工作實在是不順利。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夏櫟","speakerId":"avg_492_quercu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以到底遇到什麼事了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其實也不是什麼事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最近城裡那些傳聞，你們都聽過吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，你說的是報紙上講的那些都市傳說？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夏櫟","speakerId":"avg_492_quercu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還是那些吧。什麼“城市地下傳來異響”“感染者社區隱藏了匪幫”之類的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊......我本來是想去調查一下的，前幾天專門寫了報告。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是警備隊的人根本不在乎嘛！都讓我不要多管閒事！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？調查都市傳說也是騎警的工作？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可不是這樣哦，小蘇茜！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從我的工作經驗來說，一般城市裡出現這些流言，往往伴隨著一些隱藏在流言背後的犯罪行為。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就比如“地下傳來異響”這個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們知道嗎，卡拉頓地下有很多廢棄的物流通道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夏櫟","speakerId":"avg_492_quercu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是，早些年移動城區設計的時候在結構層設計了不少通道，但是隨著城市的發展，很多老區塊的地下通道維護困難，就全都棄用了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是哦，比如感染者社區下面就有不少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以你明白嗎，那個傳言如果是真的，就代表晚上有人在廢棄的物流通道裡幹什麼見不得人的事情哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......聽起來有點嚇人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可惜現在還沒有什麼直接證據就是了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夏櫟","speakerId":"avg_492_quercu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我覺得你也沒必要這麼糾結啦，這些本來應該是警備隊的工作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夏櫟","speakerId":"avg_492_quercu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回頭真出了什麼事情，都是他們偷懶不幹活，你怕什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"話是這樣說啦......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，現在是巡邏時間，我在這裡待著也算是偷懶吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈......我們不會告訴別人啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小~蘇~茜~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"讓我揉一揉你的耳朵！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，但是小心靜電哦？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_mini02_victoria_street_n"},{"type":"narration","text":"1097年11月24日 6:15 P.M."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"在“綠意火花”的廢墟前，站著一位瞠目結舌的庫蘭塔騎警。\n在她眼前，那間充滿人情味的小店——屋頂垮落，牆壁崩塌，只剩下一片焦黑的殘骸。\n她茫然地看著眼前的廢墟，不敢相信自己的眼睛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......為什麼會？？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為......為什麼？？為什麼會......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"消防隊成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊，你來了，格拉尼小姐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這，這是怎麼回事？？為什麼這家店......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"消防隊成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我也覺得離譜啊，你說在這種地方縱火，只可能是有仇了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"縱火？？有人縱火？？？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這家店的店員呢？那個菲林小姐呢？你們見到她了嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"消防隊成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"沒見到，不過半夜失火的時候店裡沒人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"消防隊成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好在沒有人員傷亡啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到底是什麼人幹的！"},{"type":"narration","text":"憤怒。\n她握緊了自己的拳頭。\n幾乎每周都會光顧的小酒吧，那位可愛的店員小姐，那些有趣的客人......在這個城市中難得的休憩之地，現在已經化為一片焦燃廢墟。\n難以遏制的憤怒充斥著格拉尼的腦海——她很少如此憤怒。\n無論犯人是誰，自己都要把他繩之以法。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"消防隊成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"欸！別進去！廢墟都還沒清理乾淨呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係，我來看看案發現場，說不定有什麼收獲呢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"消防隊成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"別費事啦，騎警小姐。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"消防隊成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"早上警備隊的人就來過了，他們檢查了一圈，定性為意外失火，就都走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"意外失火？可是剛才你不是說......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"消防隊成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那只是我們消防隊的意見，畢竟我們在現場確實發現了很多東西，比如這個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是什麼......爆炸物的殘留？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"消防隊成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，但是警備隊讓我們別多事，我就沒說什麼了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"消防隊成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"感染者社區的事情......反正也沒什麼人管，多一事不如少一事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些證物能交給我嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"消防隊成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可以啊，我還正覺得它們燙手，自己不該拿著......反正你也是警備隊的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看看......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不對......這是軍用燃燒彈的碎片！以前在騎警隊訓練的時候見過這種東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些碎片，有點眼熟？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_towerinside"},{"type":"narration","text":"1097年11月26日 7:15 A.M."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咱們又見面了，昴德先生？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嗓門男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_195","isRemote":false,"text":"騎......騎警？？？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剛被放出來？我以為他們會拘留得更久一點呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嗓門男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_195","isRemote":false,"text":"別再抓我進去了，求求你騎警小姐！我不過就是個打雜的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嗓門男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_195","isRemote":false,"text":"我最近真的沒有去騷擾那些感染者，相信我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還記得前幾天我抓你的時候，收繳的贓物裡的那個燃燒彈嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嗓門男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_195","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你之前說自己只買了一個“防身用”的燃燒彈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但軍用燃燒彈外殼的獨特設計是很明顯的，即便碎裂了也不難辨認，你猜猜我手裡的這一塊是在什麼地方發現的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你沒說實話哦，和我再去一次警備隊吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嗓門男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_195","isRemote":false,"text":"別！我說！我什麼都說！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嗓門男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_195","isRemote":false,"text":"我其實買了一箱！是一箱！但是我全轉手賣給別人了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嗓門男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_195","isRemote":false,"text":"是丹頓兄弟！我賣給丹頓兄弟了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"丹頓兄弟？他們是什麼人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嗓門男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_195","isRemote":false,"text":"那兩個敘拉古移民！兩個黑幫打手！你去問問沸區的人！他們知道！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼你知道他們為什麼要燒掉感染者社區的酒吧嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嗓門男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_195","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道！我真的不知道！我都完全沒聽過酒吧的事情！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嗓門男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_195","isRemote":false,"text":"這些燃燒彈也、也是我從沸區黑市上買的！我說的都是真的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嗓門男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_195","isRemote":false,"text":"但是黑市那個商人說，自己有門路直接從工廠弄一些貨物......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（卡拉頓的工廠......似乎只有貝希曼伯爵有一家製造軍用物資的工廠......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"丹頓兄弟，你知道這兩個人在哪嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嗓門男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_195","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我不清楚，我只知道他們經常混跡在沸區......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沸區啊......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_offce"},{"type":"narration","text":"1097年11月27日 6:15 P.M."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"警備隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"都跟你說了多少次了，盜賊抓到沒有？巡邏完成沒有？也就你們這些騎警隊的雜耍藝人，才喜歡管這些雞毛蒜皮的小事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說這是雞毛蒜皮的小事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"警備隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"不是嗎！感染者社區的一個小酒吧，你還要花兩三天時間調查它為什麼被燒掉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"警備隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"電路短路、得罪幫派、被雷劈了，我還能想出一百個理由。最後查下來根本沒有犯人，這段時間耽誤的案子誰負責？你嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那這些證據呢？這些軍用燃燒彈是貝希曼議員的工廠生產的，這些本來是提供給維多利亞軍隊的物資！但是這些武器卻流入了黑市！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"難道不應該查一下那家工廠嗎？？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"警備隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"那可是貝希曼伯爵的財產！你還敢去查議員家的工廠？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"警備隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"你膽子可不小啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"軍用爆炸物！地下黑市！證據都擺在面前了！你還在這裡說瞎話？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"難不成這些黑市交易，你也有份？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"警備隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"你！你知道你在說什麼嗎？你居然敢這麼說我？？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你覺得你能騙過誰？貝希曼伯爵是你的親戚，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"警備隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"你......你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你這樣的人，到底是怎麼坐到警備隊長這個位置上的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"感染者社區的案件你不管不顧，沸區幫派成災你也熟視無睹。現在這麼大的事情你又不查了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你的工作是什麼？你已經失職了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡拉頓警備隊還有合格的執法人員嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"警備隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"你要造反不成？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是被城鎮議會借調來的騎警隊成員！我現在就是卡拉頓城騎警隊的負責人，我和你是平級的！你本來就無權向我下達命令！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"警備隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"......好啊！我就知道你們這些鄉巴佬......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"警備隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"你等著，你等大公爵從倫蒂尼姆回來，我要好好彙報一下你們“騎警隊”的工作態度！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你隨意！再見！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"警備隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"低賤的雜耍藝人、該死的破落戶......等大公爵回來，有你好受的！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_bar_1"},{"type":"narration","text":"1097年11月28日 7:15 P.M.\n卡拉頓沸區 白房子酒吧"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魁梧的黑衣人","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"這些人怎麼搞的，已經拖延一天了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鬼祟的黑衣人","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"難不成是工廠那邊出了什麼差錯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魁梧的黑衣人","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"那現在怎麼辦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鬼祟的黑衣人","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"再等等......如果到今天晚上都還沒有消息，咱們提前撤。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒保","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"請問有什麼能幫到您的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您好，我在尋找兩個叫作“丹頓兄弟”的人，有人說看到他們偶爾在這間酒吧出沒......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魁梧的黑衣人","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"壞了！怎麼警備隊都找到這裡來了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鬼祟的黑衣人","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"別怕！這裡可是沸區，她不敢幹什麼的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈！找到你們了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魁梧的黑衣人","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼這位......啊，這位騎警小姐，您找我們兄弟倆有什麼事嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麻煩兩位和我一起去一趟警備隊，有關24日清晨的感染者社區縱火案，我有一些事情想要問你們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鬼祟的黑衣人","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"那我們要是不走呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請配合執法人員的工作，丹頓先生。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒保","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"別太囂張了，騎警！這裡可是沸區，這裡你說了不算。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒保","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"滾出去，我的店不歡迎你。"},{"type":"narration","text":"一瞬間，酒吧裡的氣氛開始緊張起來，幾個面相兇惡的大漢從座位上站了起來。\n他們掏出了武器，不懷好意地看著這位個頭矮小的騎警。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鬼祟的黑衣人","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈，騎警小姐，這裡可是卡拉頓沸區，你們騎警隊那一套在這裡不適用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鬼祟的黑衣人","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"您還是回去繼續幫那些感染者刷馬桶吧，你也就配幹這個了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（歎氣）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（九個人......回頭的書面報告可有的寫了......）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_mini02_victoria_street_n"},{"type":"narration","text":"1097年11月28日 7:50 P.M.\n卡拉頓街道"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鬼祟的黑衣人","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"跑！快跑，她還在後面！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魁梧的黑衣人","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"我的手斷了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鬼祟的黑衣人","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"忍住！先跑，這騎警腦子有病吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魁梧的黑衣人","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"這根本打不過啊！騎警都是這種人嗎？？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鬼祟的黑衣人","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"別管了，往感染者社區跑，那邊地形複雜，還有機會！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_u"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魁梧的黑衣人","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"她追上了沒？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鬼祟的黑衣人","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"閉嘴，小點聲！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鬼祟的黑衣人","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"她沒發現我們，躲在這就行了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魁梧的黑衣人","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"*粗口*，這騎警有毛病吧，她到底是怎麼查到我們的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鬼祟的黑衣人","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"別廢話了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“女巫”小敏","speakerId":"avg_npc_045_nn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們......是什麼人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鬼祟的黑衣人","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"誰？？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魁梧的黑衣人","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"哪兒來的小鬼？？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“女巫”小敏","speakerId":"avg_npc_045_nn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡是女巫姐姐的家，你們在這裡幹什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鬼祟的黑衣人","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"讓她閉嘴！那個騎警就在外面！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魁梧的黑衣人","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"臭小鬼，你最好給我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“女巫”小敏","speakerId":"avg_npc_045_nn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我懂了！你們是壞人！"},{"type":"narration","text":"稚嫩的女巫伸出了右手，青紫色的霹靂在她的手中跳躍。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_mini02_victoria_street_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（可惡，跑到哪兒去了？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您好......請問你們有沒有看到......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"就在庫蘭塔騎警向附近的居民搭話時，兩個黑衣服的男人從不遠處屋子的窗戶裡飛了出來，重重地撞在了牆上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鬼祟的黑衣人","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"燙燙燙！這臭小鬼！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魁梧的黑衣人","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"*粗口*，混帳感染者，我要把她......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好啊！你們倆原來躲在這了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鬼祟的黑衣人","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"*粗口*，快跑！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魁梧的黑衣人","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"還能往哪跑？？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鬼祟的黑衣人","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"廢棄城區！那邊有個安全屋！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_G6_decisivebattlealley_n"},{"type":"narration","text":"1097年11月28日 8:59 P.M.\n卡拉頓邊緣廢棄城區\n兩個黑衣人氣喘吁吁地奔跑在無人的街道上。\n而那位矮小的庫蘭塔騎警緊隨其後。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鬼祟的黑衣人","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"甩掉了沒？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魁梧的黑衣人","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼可能甩得掉！你想在城市裡甩掉一個庫蘭塔騎警？繼續跑！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鬼祟的黑衣人","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"還有多遠？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魁梧的黑衣人","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"馬上就到了！就在前面。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_towerinside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鬼祟的黑衣人","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"到了到了，就是這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魁梧的黑衣人","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"接頭的人就在這？這安全屋也太破了吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鬼祟的黑衣人","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"別那麼多廢話，他們之前說好了的，在這裡準備好出城用的衣服和假證明，這裡有一條通往舊物流通道的密道，可以想辦法溜出去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_G6_decisivebattlealley_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"躲在小屋裡啊，還不打算放棄嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要挑戰我的耐心哦？這裡已經是城市邊緣了，你們已經沒有退路了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"順帶提醒你們倆，想要躲在那個破屋子裡伏擊我也沒有用哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"繼續抵抗，只會讓你們的罪名越來越多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放下你們手裡的弩械和爆炸物，立刻投降。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_towerinside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鬼祟的黑衣人","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼回事，人呢？怎麼連燈都不開？？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魁梧的黑衣人","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"這屋子裡怎麼這麼亂！地上這堆東西都是什麼啊，看都看不清楚。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鬼祟的黑衣人","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"你把什麼碰倒了！這什麼味道！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魁梧的黑衣人","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡太黑了！什麼都看不到！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鬼祟的黑衣人","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"為啥堆了這麼多東西？怎麼搞的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魁梧的黑衣人","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"這不對勁！說好的接頭人呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鬼祟的黑衣人","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"這破屋有問題啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_G6_decisivebattlealley_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你們還不出來的話，我就要物理突破這間屋子了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"該讓你們見識一下騎警的實力了。"},{"type":"narration","text":"矮小的騎警反握長槍，壓低身體，將長槍舉過頭頂，源石技藝彙聚在武器的尖端，整個長槍在夜色中發出殷紅的光澤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可很久沒用這招了，受傷了可別怪我哦？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_towerinside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魁梧的黑衣人","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"快想想辦法！她要破門了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鬼祟的黑衣人","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"先別慌！冷靜點！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鬼祟的黑衣人","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"手電筒！你帶了沒？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魁梧的黑衣人","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"誰閒得沒事幹隨身帶手電筒！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鬼祟的黑衣人","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"燃燒彈！之前還剩一個對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魁梧的黑衣人","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"你要把這燒了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鬼祟的黑衣人","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"你傻啊！你先把燃燒彈丟到裡屋去，我們趁著燒起來之前溜出去，回頭房子燒起來，那個騎警也不敢追我們，一舉兩得！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魁梧的黑衣人","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"有道理！讓我看看......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"魁梧的黑衣人拉開了軍用燃燒彈的拉環，丟到了漆黑小屋的深處。\n然而——\n當火光亮起的一瞬間，他們終於意識到自己做出了一個多麼愚蠢的決定。\n在狹小的破屋子裡，堆放著大量的源石爆炸物與危化品。\n原先他們碰倒了鐵桶，高濃度的酮原料流淌一地。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_G6_decisivebattlealley_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我最後倒數三聲，這是你們最後的機會了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"三！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"二！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一！"},{"type":"narration","text":"折疊式軍用長槍如閃電般射出，擊碎了十幾釐米厚的水泥牆壁，撕裂了牆體。\n然而下一刻......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"雷鳴般的爆炸聲響徹整個卡拉頓城。\n刺眼的火光伴隨著蘑菇雲直衝雲霄，照亮了廢棄地塊，照亮了高多汀的夜晚，照亮了維多利亞西南邊的海港。\n伴隨著小屋爆炸，周邊的地面結構全部塌陷，墜落到了城區地塊的結構層。\n而年久失修的結構層繼續崩塌，向下墜落，發出一陣持續不斷的轟鳴。\n原本廢棄小屋的位置，如同被高速戰艦炮擊過一般，只剩下一個冒著濃煙的巨大坑洞。\n嫌疑犯、證據與真相，都與那間廢棄小屋一同化為黑煙隨風飄走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......？？？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_220_grani_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什......什麼情況？？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"被爆炸氣浪掀翻在地的維多利亞騎警一臉茫然地看著眼前的一切，此刻的她尚未反應過來發生了什麼。\n1097年11月28日。\n卡拉頓城的夜晚分外熱鬧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
